# 2025-06-18

https://github.com/cvmfs/cvmfs/blob/devel/packaging/rpm/cvmfs-universal.spec
Tested on Version: 2.13.0

========================================
# without selinux
%define selinux_cvmfs 0
%define selinux_cvmfs_server 0

# without golang utilities
%define build_gateway 0
%define build_ducc 0
%define build_snapshotter 0
========================================
Pridanie tychto riadkov (napr. pred klucove slovo 'Summary') do suboru
'cvmfs-universal.spec' umozni kompilaciu bez selinux, resp. bez golang. Menej
zavislosti a rychlejsie kompilacia. Idealne pri vytvarani rpm balika na nejakom
lokalnom PC.

========================================
#BuildRequires: valgrind-devel
========================================
Tato zavislost uz v skutocnosti nie je potrebna, mozno zakomentovat. Zbytocna
instalacia znacneho mnozstva nepotrebnych balikov.
